ficient for this workflow.\n./skills/fix-missing-reachability-metadata/SKILL.md-66-\n./skills/fix-missing-reachability-metadata/SKILL.md:67:### Inactive Condition (metadata present but too late)\n./skills/fix-missing-reachability-metadata/SKILL.md-68-\n./skills/fix-missing-reachability-metadata/SKILL.md:69:If GraalVM reports that metadata for an access was found but is inactive because its runtime\n./skills/fix-missing-reachability-metadata/SKILL.md:70:condition was not satisfied, treat the existing `condition` as too late for that access. Read the\n./skills/fix-missing-reachability-metadata/SKILL.md-71-access stack and move or duplicate the matching entry under the narrowest library type that is\n./skills/fix-missing-reachability-metadata/SKILL.md-72-reached *before* the access occurs. Do not reuse an unsatisfied condition merely because it relates\n./skills/fix-missing-reachability-metadata/SKILL.md-73-to the same library feature.\n./skills/fix-missing-reachability-metadata/SKILL.md-74-\n./skills/fix-missing-reachability-metadata/SKILL.md-75-## Environment Troubleshooting\n./skills/fix-missing-reachability-metadata/SKILL.md-76-\n--\n./forge/utility_scripts/native_test_verification.py-40-\n./forge/utility_scripts/native_test_verification.py-41-STATUS_PASSED = \"PASSED\"\n./forge/utility_scripts/native_test_verification.py-42-STATUS_PASSED_WITH_INTERVENTION = \"PASSED_WITH_INTERVENTION\"\n./forge/utility_scripts/native_test_verification.py-43-STATUS_FAILED = \"FAILED\"\n./forge/utility_scripts/native_test_verification.py-44-\n./forge/utility_scripts/native_test_verification.py-45-# Exit code emitted by ExitStatus.MISSING_METADATA when the binary was built\n./forge/utility_scripts/native_test_verification.py:46:# with -H:MissingRegistrationReportingMode=Exit and encounters missing\n./forge/utility_scripts/native_test_verification.py-47-# reachability metadata at runtime.\n./forge/utility_scripts/native_test_verification.py-48-MISSING_METADATA_EXIT_CODE = 172\n./forge